{"abstract":"We report on an inversion tool for a class of oriented conditional constructor term rewriting systems. Four well-behaved rule inverters ranging from trivial to full, partial and semi-inverters are included. Conditional term rewriting systems are theoretically well founded and can model functional and non-functional rewrite relations. We illustrate the inversion by experiments with full and partial inversions of the Ackermann function. The case study demonstrates, among others, that polyvariant inversion and input-output set propagation can reduce the search space of the generated inverse systems.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Mikkelsen, Maria Bendix","Glück, Robert","Kirkeby, Maja Hanne"],"cuid":["S02-096.98-046895"],"event":{"end":"2021-03-28","place":"Virtual, Luxembourg, lu","start":"2021-03-27","title":"9th International Workshop on Verification and Program Transformation, VPT 2021","year":"2021"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Case study","Program inversion","Program transformation","Term rewriting systems"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum","sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU","DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"an inversion tool for conditional term rewriting systems a case study of ackermann inversion","src":["ku","ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU","DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.4204/EPTCS.341.3","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-096.98-046895","identifier":[{"id":"85115213254","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-e3561750-83e7-4652-b9c1-0827d8b58ab7","ruc-79b58d5a-ecc1-456c-8dfb-03c2aceb5352"],"keyword":["Case study","Program inversion","Program transformation","Term rewriting systems"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["H